{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f8d1fe30bd90841e24b7f51ebe4d75599238d5d123c77704218a799d796ccff7","ja":"今年もお疲れ様！","zh":"今年也辛苦了！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2532894a86ed298cdc4ae8c3da691d46bce5d182ffeedb93e0ce102cefed1a30","ja":"ふぅ……やっとこれでオレたちも仕事納めだな♪","zh":"呼……这样一来，我们总算也结束这一年的工作啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c3f0f842be1fe289bebe653afb1942e9b29259d635fffb5f575142f3eeb30d1d","ja":"年末まで特番とか生放送があって、\n大忙しだったね！","zh":"到年底为止一直有特别节目和直播，\n真是忙得不可开交呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9c12aea0851c7b455d6afc8ca0a06901ea0dc30d0c013109485439885993dd2c","ja":"でも、●●●●プロデューサーさんは、\nまだまだ大忙しみたいだよ。","zh":"不过，●●●●制作人先生\n好像还非常忙碌呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ecd05b5fb7a819712175f64272b28943447e553e0cafe46d262da974a45faf4c","ja":"「打ち合わせが残ってるから\n先に戻っててくれ」、だって。","zh":"“说还有会要开，\n让先回去呢”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"fc0df0e2feabca6432cbeee34b1b37596b4c058314f522954dc0e08180d6473f","ja":"こんなに忙しいなんて、\n栄養不足で体を壊しちゃわないか心配だよね……。","zh":"这么忙，\n真担心会不会因为营养不良搞坏身体啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"84343e905b006d529aaea810198283b11b7e29a33fea7bd81d209c04b2134f65","ja":"でも、●●●●プロデューサーがいてくれると、\nなんか、仕事がうまくいく気がするんだよなー。","zh":"不过，只要有●●●●制作人在，\n总觉得工作就能顺利进行呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"738e6235ccab225434d2a77db51493a89cfe7ab87c18b2782e9866f85d96a096","ja":"うんうん！　本番中は私たちをじーっと\n見てるだけなのに、なんだか不思議だよね！","zh":"嗯嗯！演出时明明只是目不转睛地\n看着我们，总觉得好不可思议呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1ae65057362b21cfa0354789a847baef56f94d1cec6eb42fe34ffe1fc8e948e1","ja":"どんなに忙しくても見守ってくれる\n●●●●プロデューサーさんに、お礼がしたいな……。","zh":"无论有多忙都在注视着我的\n●●●●制作人，真想好好向您道谢呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d7dcf2a879d259ef605f392f9036dcdafcceb20b63c682ac6f13f36074687612","ja":"そうだ！　私たちで、●●●●プロデューサーさんの\n仕事納めをお祝いしちゃいませんか？","zh":"对了！不如由我们来给●●●●制作人\n庆祝一下今年的工作收尾，怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"275721d4a8eb1d00a71c8d77b693d3256f69d500e9181265c2bebf9028debe3b","ja":"わぁ、すっごく面白そう！　私は賛成～♪\nたっぷり感謝を伝えなきゃだね♪","zh":"哇，感觉超级有趣！我赞成～♪\n得好好向大家表达感谢才行呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e396a76322b795a48aaaf1ca40b316ff1416ae27f8fb0e16a1447e2d216ddad2","ja":"もちろん、オレも賛成だぜ！\nでも、お祝いってなにをするんだ？","zh":"我当然也赞成啦！\n不过，庆祝是要做什么啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1344.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d8f5927cee5e14272f2314c0f35b0ffad6f54b0d63d3a79117f5d1a87c98a5d4","ja":"それはね……●●●●プロデューサーさんのために、\n栄養たっぷりの特製年越しそばを作るの♪","zh":"那就是……为了●●●●制作人，\n做一碗营养满满的特制跨年荞麦面哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
